window.__T__=[{"i":19120,"text":"Create a premium cinematic travel poster in a sophisticated double-exposure / silhouette collage style. A stylish young adult woman walking toward the right side of the frame, wearing a beige wide-brimmed safari hat, dark sunglasses, elegant white oversized button-up shirt with rolled sleeves, high-waisted cream trousers, white sneakers, and a small brown leather crossbody bag. Preserve realistic human proportions and natural walking posture.\nBehind and partially merged into the woman’s silhouette is a breathtaking golden Sahara desert landscape at sunset: vast rolling sand dunes, dramatic layered mountains, warm orange sunlight, a glowing sun near the horizon, palm trees surrounding a small desert oasis, traditional desert village architecture, ancient stone towers, tents, and a small camel caravan crossing the dunes.\nThe desert landscape forms an artistic human-profile silhouette on the left side, seamlessly blending into the woman's walking composition on the right. Elegant paint-splash and ink-brush edges around the landscape, subtle dust particles, soft atmospheric haze, warm golden-hour lighting, luxury travel editorial aesthetic, sophisticated minimal composition.\nBackground: clean warm ivory/cream paper texture with large negative space on the right and lower area. High-end tourism campaign poster, artistic commercial photography, photorealistic desert details, realistic fabric texture, cinematic depth, refined composition, premium magazine advertising style.\nComposition: vertical 4:5, full-body woman on the right, desert silhouette dominating the left, balanced negative space, clean edges, no text, no logo, no watermark, ultra-detailed, high resolution.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTwr_EibIAAqNhr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTwr_70bIAAd53f.jpg"]},{"i":19121,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n摄影风格：日间清亮高光CCD生活照风\n写真方向：都市建筑生活写真\n场景方向：现代商业建筑开放中庭 / 白色旋转楼梯 / 玻璃天窗 / 浅灰石材 / 极简绿植\n服装方向：薄荷蓝绿色修身Polo短款上衣 + 冷白色低腰包臀超短裙\n气质标签：知性、俏皮、明亮、精致、有设计感\n五官方向：电影感清秀自然脸\n身形方向：轻盈纤细\n线条强调：强\n镜头方向：大腿及上半身\n姿态动作：站在旋转楼梯起点，一只手轻扶白色扶手，身体微侧，抬眼自然看镜头\n光线氛围：玻璃天窗高亮日光 + 白色楼梯形成大面积柔亮反射\n滤镜效果：高亮清晰青白CCD色彩 + 白净高光 + 清楚中间调 + 极轻颗粒\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：薄荷蓝绿保持鲜亮，不灰不雾；楼梯形成明显空间纵深；短款Polo露出腰腹和肚脐，整体像城市建筑随手拍","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3d-qTbwAAeOtc.jpg"]},{"i":19122,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n风格方向： 夜晚家务陪伴情绪\n场景方向： 卧室床尾 / 洗衣篮 / 折好的衣物\n服装方向： 雾玫瑰色修身短袖针织上衣 + 奶白色柔软家居超短裙\n气质标签： 温柔、松弛、亲近、生活化、轻熟\n身形方向： 丰腴自然曲线\n线条强调： 中偏强\n镜头方向： 女生坐在床尾边缘整理衣服，男友 POV 位于她侧前方；她刚折好一件衣服，一只手把衣服递向镜头，另一只手撑在床边保持稳定，身体轻微前倾并偏向镜头，抬眼像在催男友接过去\n画幅比例： 9:16\n互动重点： “你也来帮忙”的情侣生活感，比单纯递东西更自然。\n曲线重点： 床边坐姿 + 轻前倾自然形成胸腰、大腿比例，双脚落地避免悬空感。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2p0labMAAZBAL.jpg"]},{"i":19123,"text":"生成一张3:4竖版的超现实雕塑静物摄影。画面只有一个【主体】，由【材质】制成，主体呈【主体色】，置于【背景色】的无缝摄影背景与同色哑光地面上。\n让这个原本坚硬的熟悉物体，仅在细长的中段打成一个真正的、松而清晰的单结。中段自身连续弯绕：先绕成开口环，再将同一物体的一端穿过环，形成打绳结般的交叉穿绕结构。可从一端沿着材质表面追踪完整路径，经过弯曲、前后交叉与穿环，直到另一端；结中央留出可见空隙。不要画成直杆穿过独立圆环，不要套环或圆圈装饰，也不要仅画一个弯钩。结以外的两端保留该物体原本的形状与识别特征，完整入镜，沿对角方向舒展开，不能截断或藏住。它始终是一个连续完整的物体，不是两件物品拼接，不加入绳索，不增加分叉或多余末端。\n让原材质的纹理、厚度、边缘与反光沿弯曲处连续延伸；结区仍是原材质，不变成橡胶、软管或布料。把不可能的弯折拍成可信的实体雕塑，表面完好，没有断裂、熔化或接缝。\n主体居中，占画面约七成，四周留白；三分之四视角，近距离中焦镜头，物体全身清晰。左上方大面积柔光配轻微侧后轮廓光，突出材质与结的立体层次。物体自然接触地面，有细腻接触阴影和柔和投影，不悬浮。背景干净，无道具，无文字、标志、水印或拼图。\n\n🔁延伸玩法\n本次三个示例的参数：\n餐叉：【主体】金属餐叉；【材质】抛光不锈钢；【主体色】银色；【背景色】浅暖灰\n铅笔：【主体】木杆铅笔；【材质】未涂漆的天然木材与石墨；【主体色】温暖原木色；【背景色】雾蓝色\n花瓶：【主体】细长长颈陶瓷花瓶；【材质】细腻亮釉陶瓷；【主体色】象牙白；【背景色】浅杏橙色\n也可以围绕同一种物品，探索不同材质的反差。检查时重点看中段是否真的交叉穿绕，以及弯曲处是否还保有原本质感。\n\n📌一句话总结\n让坚硬的东西做出柔软的动作，让材质本身制造惊讶。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTxce4YbQAAH0eU.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTxcgmcagAAGqxq.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTxcgmcakAAQVEb.jpg"]},{"i":19124,"text":"Create a 30-second ultra-realistic cinematic comedy video inside a modern professional hair salon. The subject is an orange-headed parrot sitting calmly in a small salon chair, wearing a miniature black barber cape. A professional stylist carefully grooms and trims the parrot’s head feathers as if giving it a fashionable haircut. Realistic feathers, natural bird movement, detailed salon environment, believable human hand movements, cinematic lighting, subtle humor, 4K. No text, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.\n\n[0–5s] — PREPARATION\nExtreme close-up of the orange-headed parrot sitting calmly beneath a professional salon light. The stylist gently lifts the feathers on top of its head with a fine comb, carefully examining their shape. The parrot blinks naturally and looks slightly curious. A circular ring light reflects realistically in its eyes.\n\n[5–10s] — THE TRIM\nThe stylist uses small silver scissors to carefully trim the top feathers. Precise snipping movements shape the feathers evenly while the parrot remains surprisingly patient. Cut between close-ups of the scissors, comb, feathers, and the parrot’s expressive face.\n\n[10–14s] — WATER SPRAY\nThe stylist picks up a small spray bottle and gently sprays a fine mist over the parrot’s head. Tiny water droplets settle naturally on the feathers. The parrot briefly shakes its head, then returns to its serious salon-client expression.\n\n[14–19s] — STYLING\nThe stylist combs the damp feathers upward and begins shaping them into a neat, fashionable style. The camera slowly moves around the parrot’s head, revealing detailed feather texture and realistic reflections from the salon lighting.\n\n[19–24s] — FINAL TOUCHES\nClose-up of the stylist making tiny precision trims with the scissors. Loose feather particles fall gently onto the black cape. The parrot watches itself in a small salon mirror, tilting its head from side to side as if inspecting the haircut.\n\n[24–27s] — THE REVEAL\nThe stylist removes the comb and steps back. The camera slowly pushes toward the parrot’s face. Its freshly styled orange feathers look perfectly shaped. The parrot blinks, subtly tilts its head, and looks extremely proud of its new hairstyle.\n\n[27–30s] — COMEDIC ENDING\nThe parrot suddenly turns toward the camera and gives a confident little head shake, making its freshly styled feathers bounce perfectly into place. Hold on its serious expression for a humorous final beat.\n\nSTYLE: ultra-realistic animal cinematography, photorealistic parrot feathers, realistic bird anatomy and eye movement, authentic salon environment, natural human hand motion, detailed scissors and comb, realistic water droplets, professional beauty-salon lighting, ring-light reflections, cinematic depth of field, macro feather details, subtle comedy, 4K HDR.\n\nAUDIO: gentle salon ambience, scissors softly clicking, comb brushing through feathers, fine water spray, subtle bird movements and quiet chirps. No dialogue, no music.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2106696735481532416/img/JorynP9-R1qcT7NL.jpg"]},{"i":19125,"text":"Studio portrait of one smiling person holding a Cheetos Crunchy orange chips bag close to the camera, both the bag and the person’s head in the foreground. Captured with an ultra-wide fisheye lens for a playful, youthful, energetic feel.\nThe model wears a glossy bright orange puffer jacket over a white t-shirt.\nBackground in a vibrant orange gradient with light yellow accents, bold and fun.\nSoft cinematic lighting, juicy highlights, slight saturation boost, modern snack-ad editorial style.\nExpressive smile, fun street-commercial aesthetic.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTyqEPzagAAi_Rq.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTyqEPubsAAn61W.jpg"]},{"i":19126,"text":"Create a 30-second ultra-realistic cinematic nighttime video of three adorable fluffy kittens dancing together on a lively urban sidewalk.\n\nThe kittens:\n• White kitten wearing a pink bow\n• Cream-colored kitten wearing a yellow bow\n• White-and-black kitten wearing a blue bow\n\nKeep their appearance, fur patterns, bows, size, and proportions consistent throughout. Their movements should feel synchronized, playful, cute, and physically believable.\n\n[0–5s] — THE INTRO\nLow-angle shot of a busy city sidewalk at night. Blurred car headlights and taillights glow in the background, with illuminated high-rise buildings and streetlights creating colorful bokeh. The three kittens step into frame together and begin moving rhythmically.\n\n[5–10s] — THE DANCE\nThe kittens sway their fluffy bodies from side to side and move their front paws in synchronized little motions. Their bows bounce naturally with every movement. The camera slowly tracks backward as they dance toward it.\n\n[10–15s] — WALKING FORWARD\nThey continue dancing while walking forward in perfect rhythm. The pink-bow kitten leads slightly, while the cream and black-and-white kittens follow beside it. Their paws make tiny natural steps on the pavement.\n\n[15–20s] — CLOSE TRACKING\nThe camera moves closer at their eye level. Capture detailed realistic fur, tiny whiskers, expressive eyes, and playful facial expressions. They continue their synchronized paw movements while city lights shimmer behind them.\n\n[20–25s] — BIGGER MOMENT\nThe kittens perform their cutest synchronized move: a small side-to-side sway followed by two playful paw raises. Their bows bounce as they continue moving forward. Cars pass behind them, creating smooth streaks of light.\n\n[25–30s] — FINAL SHOT\nThe camera slowly pulls back into a wider low-angle shot as the three kittens continue dancing together down the illuminated sidewalk. They finish with a synchronized little pose, looking toward the camera as the vibrant city glows behind them.\n\nSTYLE: ultra-realistic fluffy fur, photorealistic kittens, cinematic nighttime photography, vibrant urban lighting, realistic reflections, colorful bokeh, detailed whiskers and eyes, natural animal movement, smooth synchronized animation, low-angle tracking camera, subtle handheld feel, gentle panning, shallow depth of field, 4K HDR.\n\nAUDIO: lively nighttime city ambience, distant traffic, soft footsteps, subtle playful music, and natural kitten sounds. No dialogue, no text, logos, subtitles, or watermark.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2106804584903761920/img/TUHX2hLtUxakpakK.jpg"]},{"i":19127,"text":"一幅3:4竖幅无字画面。\n【主体】是儿童随手画出的极简简笔伙伴，全身完整可见，约占画面高度四成；只用醒目、圆头、略带手绘起伏的粗白笔触勾勒外轮廓、四肢与极少五官，笔触宽度约为主体头宽的三十五分之一，如粗头白色画笔留下的二维线画，轮廓内部完全不填色，能看见后方环境。白线仅带贴着线条的微弱柔光，不照亮周围。\n【动作】。主体与真实物件的接触点、遮挡和承托关系明确，动作舒展轻巧。\n【环境】以有真实材质和空间层次的摄影场景呈现，近处关键物件清楚，远处柔焦但仍可辨识。\n【漂浮细节】只出现少量，围绕动作自然分布。\n【配色】，暖光从环境里的明确光源发出，明暗柔和，保留安静空处。情绪来自正在发生的小事。\n独幅完整构图，不加文字或装饰框，不做霓虹灯管、发亮实体或贴纸白边。\n\n🔁延伸玩法\n1、雨窗热杯\n让小兔坐在亚麻软垫上，双爪抱住真实陶杯。窗外是蓝色雨夜，屋里只有一盏暖灯，杯口飘出细细热气。\n2、花园来客\n让小猫坐在石沿上，轻轻抬起一只爪，等萤火虫落下来。花叶、石头与园灯保留真实质感，远处才逐渐虚化。\n3、枕边好梦\n让小熊扶着床沿，把一枚布星放在枕边。被子有自然褶皱，脚稳稳落在地毯上，几粒光尘给这个小动作添一点童话感。\n这些是场景思路，三张示例实际使用的完整提示词会随图片附上。\n\n📌一句话总结\n给白线小伙伴一个真实的角落，再给它一件温柔的小事。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT1k1U-bYAAzmFb.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT1k1U7aQAAXXHW.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT1k1U7aEAAxwhg.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT1k7ZUbEAA_Jns.jpg"]},{"i":19128,"text":"A completely different mood. \nCreate your own dreamy vintage artwork with AI \n\nCHATGPT IMAGE \nPrompt:\n\nCreate ONE premium vertical 4:5 editorial travel poster using the uploaded photograph as the MASTER PHOTO.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nThe uploaded photograph must appear at the TOP of the final poster.\nDo NOT regenerate the photograph.\nDo NOT modify the photograph.\nDo NOT change its colors, lighting, composition, subject, mountains, rider, horse, landscape or perspective.\n\nTOP SECTION — ORIGINAL PHOTO\nPlace the uploaded photograph across the upper approximately 46–48% of the poster.\n\nThe photograph must remain completely photorealistic and visually unchanged.\n\nBOTTOM SECTION — ILLUSTRATED VERSION\nImmediately below the photograph, create a warm ivory handmade-paper background.\n\nIn the lower section, create ONE SMALL centered watercolor illustration derived directly from the SAME photograph.\n\nThe illustration must show only the essential visual elements from the photo:\n\n• the rider\n• the horse/rider subject\n• the important secondary horse if visible\n• the rider's clothing and hat\n• a very simplified mountain silhouette\n• a faint distant tree line\n• a few loose golden grass strokes\n\nThe bottom artwork must look like a delicate hand-painted travel-book illustration.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nDo NOT recreate the complete photograph in watercolor.\n\nRemove most photographic information.\n\nNo detailed sky.\nNo detailed sunset.\nNo detailed houses.\nNo fences.\nNo tiny landscape objects.\nNo large foreground.\nNo realistic atmospheric effects.\n\nThe illustration should be approximately 35–45% of the width of the lower section and relatively small.\n\nLeave LARGE empty ivory space around it.\n\nThe bottom illustration must NOT fill the lower half.\n\nUse:\nwarm ivory paper\nsoft beige\nmuted gray\nlight brown\nsubtle golden ochre\ndelicate watercolor washes\nfine ink outlines\nslightly faded vintage print character\n\nThe illustration should feel hand-painted rather than digitally rendered.\n\nLAYOUT:\n\nTOP 47%:\nORIGINAL UPLOADED PHOTOGRAPH\n\nBOTTOM 53%:\nwarm ivory textured paper\nsmall centered watercolor interpretation\nlarge negative space\nsmall title underneath\n\nTITLE:\nAdd:\n\n\"THE RIDER\"\n\nUse a very thin elegant serif font.\nUppercase.\nWide letter spacing.\nSmall size.\nCentered beneath the illustration.\n\nOVERALL STYLE:\nluxury vintage travel editorial\npremium museum-quality print\nminimalist travel-book design\nphotograph combined with delicate watercolor\nwarm sophisticated palette\nquiet elegant composition\nlarge negative space\n\nCRITICAL:\nThe top photograph and bottom illustration must represent the SAME photograph.\n\nThe bottom is simply a small artistic redraw of the main recognizable subjects from the photograph.\n\nDo not invent a new scene.\n\nDo not add new people.\n\nDo not add new animals.\n\nDo not change the main subject.\n\nDo not make the illustration large.\n\nDo not turn the bottom into another full landscape painting.\n\nNEGATIVE PROMPT:\ndifferent photograph, regenerated photograph, changed composition, changed subject, new scene, extra people, extra animals, fantasy, surrealism, CGI, 3D render, anime, cartoon, detailed watercolor landscape, oversized illustration, full-width illustration, illustration touching edges, dark paper, colorful paper, excessive watercolor, photorealistic bottom, duplicate scene, collage, border, frame, watermark, logo, random text","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT1m0E3aQAApbim.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT1m0tcbYAAQL59.jpg"]},{"i":19129,"text":"Character appearance (critical for identity accuracy — reference Image <<<image_2>>> face only):\nOval-to-heart shaped face, fair-to-medium warm-toned skin with soft natural glow, dark brown almond-shaped eyes with a defined double-eyelid crease and naturally long lashes, softly arched natural eyebrows (not overly groomed), small straight nose with a slightly rounded tip, full lips with a defined cupid's bow and a natural soft pink-mauve tone, subtle small beauty mark near the mouth, soft rounded cheeks with natural low-key contour, delicate jawline. Long straight dark brown hair, center part, face-framing strands falling naturally on both sides. Expression should read as soft, warm, and naturally expressive — not stylized, not anime-like, not overly symmetrical or \"AI-perfect.\" Preserve these exact proportions and features throughout every frame; do not drift toward a generic or idealized face.\n\nReference images: Image <<<image_1>>> (character reference — outfit, hairstyle, body, everything except the face): navy baseball cap, dark grey oversized jacket and wide-leg pants set, long straight dark brown hair, middle part, body proportions and styling. Image <<<image_2>>> (face reference ONLY — strict): use only for facial identity per the appearance description above — face shape, eyes, nose, lips, eyebrows, skin tone. Ignore clothing, hair styling, pose, lighting, background from this image.\n\nLocation (fully original, massive and majestic fairytale palace — photorealistic, light-toned, genuinely huge in scale, not a small manor or house):\nA vast open lowland meadow with a winding S-shaped stream cutting through fresh, light, vividly green grass. In the distance stands an enormous fairytale palace-complex — not a single small building, but a sprawling, monumental structure that dominates the horizon, clearly scaled many times larger than a house or manor, with a footprint wide enough to suggest an entire royal residence. The palace is enclosed by a long, low pale-stone perimeter wall with rounded corner turrets marking its boundary, giving it a sense of a fortified royal estate rather than an open building. Behind this outer wall rises the main palace structure itself: multiple tall, gracefully tapering towers of varying heights clustered together, crowned by one soaring, elongated central spire with a small gold finial that reaches dramatically higher than everything around it. Each tower is capped with a smooth cone-shaped roof in soft light teal-blue with delicate thin gold trim. Walls are pale cream and light warm-grey natural stone with real, photographically accurate texture — visible stone joints, subtle weathering, natural imperfections — grounded and believable rather than smooth, glossy, or plastic-looking. The overall silhouette should feel vast, layered, and imposing — many rooftops and towers stacked and overlapping in depth, not a single flat façade — genuinely awe-inspiring in scale even from a great distance, filling a large portion of the horizon rather than reading as a small distant object. Windows are tall, rounded-arch, evenly spaced across multiple levels, glowing with warm golden interior light against the pale stone. The palace sits far in the distance, near the horizon line — noticeably further away than a typical foreground landmark — softened by natural atmospheric haze and gentle phone-lens depth-of-field so its edges are not perfectly crisp, yet its overall silhouette, tower arrangement, and central spire remain clearly identifiable as the palace described above, not an indistinct blur. No drawbridge, no dark stone, no moss/ivy overgrowth, no logos, no signage, no text of any kind, no recognizable real-world landmark — a fully original design, shot and lit like a real photographed location.\n\nSky and light: Clear evening dusk sky in cool blue tones — no orange, amber, or golden hues anywhere in the scene. Soft fading twilight light, a few faint early stars beginning to appear, large dramatic sculptural clouds in cool blue-grey and pale lavender slowly drifting across the sky. Ambient light on the grass and figures is cool and soft, not warm.\n\nCamera setup: Not a selfie. A friend films her from a few steps away, holding an iPhone 15 Pro. Natural handheld micro-shake, realistic phone motion blur, slight auto-exposure breathing throughout, with a natural shallow depth-of-field — the distant castle and background rendered in soft focus, gently blurred like authentic phone-camera bokeh, while the foreground subject and immediate grass stay sharp — a maximally photorealistic yet authentically iPhone-shot look. Full realism throughout: real skin texture, real fabric physics, real grass and water behavior — no stylization, no illustrative or CGI look.\n\nScene (timing):\n0-7s (combined, kept tight and fast-paced — do not let this section drag): Wide shot, full body clearly visible from head to feet, standing alone in the vast meadow at a distance that keeps her entire figure in frame — no crop at the waist or knees. The camera faces her from behind/side at an angle where the palace is not yet in frame — it exists just off to the left, beyond the current framing, not visible to the viewer yet. She gazes to her left, off toward that same direction where the palace actually is, with a soft, quietly mesmerized expression — her gaze is the visual cue for the direction the scene will move toward. Cool blue dusk sky above with drifting clouds, wind moves her hair and jacket hem gently, grass sways. Within this same window, a small flock of sheep briskly crosses close past the person filming from that same left side — camera dips naturally with a subtle jolt at the moment of contact, then rises back to reframe her, still keeping her full body in frame. She turns her head to keep watching the sheep for a brief delighted glance, then turns her gaze back to that same left-hand direction, takes a short breath, and breaks into a run — running toward her left, the exact same direction she had been gazing the entire time — all within 7 seconds total, no lingering static holds.\n\n7-11s: The moment she starts running left, the friend filming begins jogging after her in that same leftward direction at an unhurried pace, phone held at the same low, steady handheld height as before — no rise, no zoom, no reframing beyond natural handheld drift, trailing a few steps behind her, camera axis staying consistent with her running direction throughout.\n\n11-12s: In one deliberate motion, the person filming lifts the phone upward and slightly outward, continuing to face the same leftward direction she has been running toward this entire time — a natural human gesture of raising the phone higher for a bigger view, revealing the vast landscape opening up ahead along that same axis. This lift happens only once, right as the palace comes into view exactly where her gaze had been pointing from the start.\n\n12-15s: With the phone held higher, the palace becomes visible for the first time, far away on the horizon along the same direction she has been running, softly hazed by distance and natural phone depth-of-field while still clearly identifiable in silhouette, set against the cool blue dusk sky with drifting clouds. The moment the palace comes into view, a bright, magical fireworks display begins above the towers — vivid bursts of warm gold, white, and soft blue-violet light, with visible glowing trails rising up before each burst and blooming into full, beautiful explosions — realistic in physics and scale but more vivid and eye-catching than a faint distant show, believable photographic quality, not garish or flat-CGI looking. After the single lift, the camera holds its new higher position steady with only natural handheld drift — no further rising, no zooming, no closing the distance. She remains a small, distant figure moving along the winding stream through the vividly fresh green meadow, running light and unhurried strictly along the grassy edge — her feet never touch or enter the water, staying a natural safe distance from the water's edge as she follows its curve. The water's surface trembles gently from the breeze, reflecting the cool blue sky and distant fireworks in soft rippling reflections rather than glassy stillness. In the distance, exactly three sheep stand grazing calmly near the palace view, correct quadruped anatomy.\n\nOverall mood: Cinematic, vast open landscape, cool blue dusk light, epic slowly-drifting cloudscape, gentle wind animating hair, clothing, grass, and water, a bright and magical yet realistic fireworks display over the distant, elegant, light-toned, massive palace, ultra-photorealistic textures, natural film grain, shallow authentic phone depth-of-field, one deliberate single phone-lift gesture exactly as the palace view opens up along the same axis she has been looking and running toward, otherwise a continuous steady handheld take at constant trailing distance, no unnatural cuts, no orange/golden tones anywhere — believable as footage shot on an iPhone by someone simply walking after her.\n\nNegative prompt: wrong face, generic/idealized face not matching reference, blended facial features from wrong source, orange or golden warm tones in sky or light, castle visible before the turn, she looks one direction and runs a different direction, camera revealing the castle on the opposite side from where she was looking, camera zooming in while she runs, camera gradually rising or craning upward while she runs, multiple lifts or repeated reframing, camera closing the distance to her, she runs into or through the water, she steps in the water, wet shoes or splashing, flat/static sky, misty/foggy castle, dark or dull grass, cropped body, close-up on face only, waist-up framing, small castle, tiny castle, single small tower, manor house, cottage-scale building, castle reads as a small distant dot, castle too close in frame, castle perfectly sharp with no atmospheric distance, cartoon castle proportions, plastic/glossy castle texture, oversaturated toy colors, Disney branding, theme park iconography, any trademarked or copyrighted structure, logos, signage, cartoonish, unnatural sheep anatomy, more or fewer than three sheep near the castle view, stiff running, oversharpened, plastic skin, warped hands, jump cuts, low frame rate stutter, she looks at camera, she smiles at camera, fireworks flat or hazy or barely visible, fireworks without rising trails, static hair/grass/water, overly polished CGI look, long static gaze scene, midday harsh light.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2106977303926587392/img/kuC_smyAvQpIka2K.jpg"]},{"i":19130,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n主题方向：东方禅意极简封面海报\n风格分支：高传播结构型\n主体内容：一位古风女子站在巨大弧形高墙下，微微抬头望向上方\n情绪母题：清醒、安静、张力\n场景与意象：巨大朱漆弧墙、浅色台面、女子、少量远山、大片留白天空\n构图与空间：9:16竖版构图，弧形高墙占据画面上半部分形成第一视觉中心，人物位于下方偏一侧，顶部与另一侧保留完整标题区\n色彩控制：暖白作为高明度基底，朱漆红用于弧墙主色块，浅灰用于台面结构，人物服装建议珍珠白或浅杏白；避免整图泛红，红色只集中在主结构\n光线与质感：明亮自然光，边缘清晰，干净平面海报感，轻微纸感即可\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：弧墙必须形成强几何记忆点，画面极简，适合高传播标题图，不要复杂建筑细节，留白处配置少量东方书法标题和现代宋体小字","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT7cHZDagAAGprX.jpg"]},{"i":19131,"text":"Create a premium 3:4 semi-realistic anime × cinematic sports photography poster featuring the person from the uploaded photo as the main character.\n\nIDENTITY REFERENCE:\n\nUse the uploaded photo as the ONLY identity reference. Preserve the person's exact recognizable facial identity, facial structure and proportions, eyes, eyebrows, nose, lips, cheekbones, jawline, chin, hairstyle, hairline, skin tone and distinctive features. Keep their natural gender presentation exactly consistent with the uploaded photo. Do not feminize, masculinize, beautify, reshape, slim, widen, age, de-age or genericize the face.\n\nSCENE & COMPOSITION:\n\nShow the person as a confident skateboarder performing a dynamic street-skating moment. Use an extreme wide-angle, ultra-low camera perspective. Place the skateboard and one wheel close to the lens in the foreground, creating strong depth and scale, while the character appears slightly farther behind it. The character must remain clearly visible and the face must be large, sharp, naturally detailed and instantly recognizable. Keep the face unobstructed and in strong visual focus.\n\nVISUAL STYLE:\n\nBlend 70% high-end cinematic sports photography + 30% premium semi-realistic anime.\n\nUse realistic anatomy, natural skin texture and believable clothing, combined with refined anime linework, subtle cel-shading, slightly stylized hair, expressive facial rendering and polished anime-inspired lighting. Create a vibrant clear-blue sky, modern urban skate environment, warm concrete surfaces, atmospheric depth, subtle flying dust and realistic clothing movement. Add controlled directional motion blur to the skateboard, wheels, dust and background while keeping the face tack-sharp.\n\nGRAPHIC ELEMENT:\n\nBehind the character's upper body, add one flat, hard-edged jagged graphic burst in a bold anime accent color such as electric lime or vivid yellow. Keep it clean and graphic — not glowing, not multiple explosions, not magical energy.\n\nANIME EDITORIAL TYPOGRAPHY:\n\nIntegrate the typography directly into the composition using premium Japanese street-anime / modern sports-anime graphic design language.\n\nMain title: \"SKATE\"\n\nUse sharp, energetic anime-inspired lettering with:\n• dynamic angular cuts\n• slightly condensed geometric forms\n• thin-to-medium strokes\n• subtle outline treatment\n• controlled offset/shadow detail\n• slight perspective or rotation\n• speed-line-inspired micro details\n• editorial Japanese anime poster energy\n\nSecondary text: \"RIDE THE MOMENT\"\n\nTypography should feel like part of a premium anime opening sequence or high-end manga sports campaign, not a childish cartoon font. Keep typography behind or around the character where appropriate, never covering the face. Maintain clean hierarchy and generous negative space.\n\nBRANDING:\n\nPlace \" small and refined at the bottom center.\n\nNo logo.\n\nQUALITY CONTROL:\n\nPremium composition, cinematic lighting, realistic perspective, crisp facial details, natural anatomy, sophisticated color grading, subtle film grain, polished semi-anime rendering, high-end sports campaign aesthetic.\n\nNo: logos, brand marks, extra text, text boxes, thick block typography, superhero elements, fantasy powers, magical effects, helmet, face covering, hidden face, distorted hands, distorted anatomy, duplicate limbs, generic model face, excessive anime exaggeration or childish cartoon styling.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2Y0nca0AAnqP2.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2Y1OnaMAAngzw.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2Y2CybAAAa9Em.jpg"]},{"i":19132,"text":"works beautifully with GPT Image 2.5, Nano Banana 2, Flux 3, Ideogram 4.5, Seedream 5 Pro.\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"prompt_name\": \"High-Contrast B&W Studio Portrait – Part 1 (Subject)\",\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"input_required\": \"ONE of: a person's name OR an uploaded reference photo. Nothing else needed.\",\n    \"if_name_given\": \"Render that person's recognisable face, age, hair and facial hair accurately. Do not invent a different identity.\",\n    \"if_image_given\": \"Preserve facial identity, bone structure, skin tone, age, hair and facial hair from the reference. Restyle and re-light only.\",\n    \"variable\": \"{{SUBJECT}}\"\n  },\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"identity\": \"{{SUBJECT}}\",\n    \"count\": 1,\n    \"pose\": {\n      \"head\": \"Straight on, no tilt, chin level, perfectly frontal\",\n      \"shoulders\": \"Square to camera, relaxed, filling the lower frame\",\n      \"gaze\": \"Straight into the lens (eyes only faintly visible behind dark lenses)\"\n    },\n    \"expression\": \"Neutral, stoic, unsmiling, lips closed and relaxed, serious and composed\",\n    \"hair\": \"Keep natural hairstyle; fine strand detail, flyaways, texture catching light\",\n    \"facial_hair\": \"Keep what the subject naturally has; coarse, individual, slightly salt-and-pepper detail if applicable\",\n    \"skin\": {\n      \"texture\": \"Raw, unretouched, hyper-detailed: visible pores, fine lines, forehead creases, blemishes, stubble shadow\",\n      \"retouching\": \"None. No smoothing, no plastic skin\",\n      \"tone_rendering\": \"Bright highlights on forehead, nose bridge, cheekbones; deep sculpted shadows under cheekbones, jaw and nose\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"eyewear\": {\n    \"type\": \"Performance sport wraparound sunglasses, 2000s Oakley-style, centred on the face\",\n    \"variant_pool_pick_one\": [\n      \"Half-rim black shield frame with white/chrome icon hardware on temples, smoky grey tinted lenses with eyes faintly visible\",\n      \"Silver/gunmetal oval wraparound frame with mirrored dark lenses and metallic icon hardware\",\n      \"Black sport shield with single mirrored lens panel and small white swoosh-style logo on brow bar, chrome temple icons\",\n      \"Black half-rim blade-style frame with grey gradient lenses\"\n    ],\n    \"lens_reflections\": \"Glossy lenses reflect the studio: bright rectangular softbox shape, dark crew/equipment silhouettes\",\n    \"material_detail\": \"Glossy black or brushed metal, crisp specular highlights, sharp edges\"\n  },\n  \"wardrobe\": {\n    \"garment\": \"Oversized black technical high-collar / funnel-neck outerwear\",\n    \"variant_pool_pick_one\": [\n      \"Matte jersey/neoprene funnel neck with diagonal zip seam and thick rolled collar standing up to the jaw\",\n      \"Padded nylon puffer with tall quilted collar, storm flap, hidden zip placket, ripstop texture\",\n      \"Matte technical shell with oversized stand collar and draped folds\",\n      \"Insulated black jacket with high collar, vertical zipper, visible seams and stitching\"\n    ],\n    \"color\": \"Solid black, no logos, no prints\",\n    \"fabric_rendering\": \"Matte with subtle sheen on folds; visible stitching, quilting, weave; deep blacks with tonal separation\",\n    \"styling_intent\": \"Futuristic, utilitarian, minimalist, high-fashion sportswear campaign\"\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2loJAaUAAGoO2.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2loJFagAAI5ZF.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2loI_aEAAe99q.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2loJCbIAA0ZHY.jpg"]},{"i":19133,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n风格方向： 夜晚洗漱后亲密照顾情绪\n场景方向： 浴室洗手台 / 镜柜 / 暖色壁灯\n服装方向： 冷雾蓝修身吊带家居裙 + 薄款针织外搭\n气质标签： 安静、温柔、亲密、轻微俏皮、松弛\n身形方向： 丰腴自然曲线\n线条强调： 强\n镜头方向： 女生站在洗手台前，身体大部分朝向镜头，一只手拿着小面霜罐，另一只手伸到镜头脸颊附近，像要帮男友点一点面霜，眼神集中在镜头脸颊位置而不是镜头中心\n画幅比例： 9:16\n互动重点： 近距离“帮你护肤”天然有情侣私密日常感。\n曲线重点： 近距离站姿略微偏向镜头即可自然表现肩颈、胸腰，不需要明显前倾。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2p0labMAAZBAL.jpg"]},{"i":19134,"text":"{\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"description\": \"A young adult woman taking an extremely close handheld selfie indoors. She has a short silver-lavender bob haircut with straight blunt bangs, large dark eyes, and a soft pale complexion. She wears an all-black gothic-inspired outfit with layered ruffles and lace. Her face dominates the frame, creating an intimate, slightly mischievous alternative-fashion portrait.\",\n    \"mirror_rules\": {\n      \"type\": \"front-facing handheld selfie\",\n      \"device_position\": \"camera held very close to the face, slightly above eye level\",\n      \"reflection_logic\": \"direct camera selfie rather than a mirror reflection\"\n    },\n    \"age\": \"Young adult visual impression; preserve the youthful styling without making a specific age claim\",\n    \"expression\": {\n      \"eyes\": {\n        \"look\": \"directly into the camera\",\n        \"energy\": \"quiet, playful, slightly mischievous\",\n        \"direction\": \"straight toward the lens\"\n      },\n      \"mouth\": {\n        \"position\": \"slightly open with a playful expression\",\n        \"energy\": \"cheeky and teasing rather than overtly sensual\"\n      },\n      \"overall\": \"A playful alternative-fashion selfie with an intentionally provocative-looking but non-explicit facial expression\"\n    },\n    \"face\": {\n      \"preserve_original\": true,\n      \"makeup\": \"minimal Japanese alternative-fashion makeup, softly defined eyes, subtle lower-eye shading, very light blush, natural pale lips, luminous but realistic skin\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"hair\": {\n    \"color\": \"very pale silver-lavender, almost white with a cool lilac tint\",\n    \"style\": \"short rounded bob with heavy straight bangs reaching toward the eyebrows and partially framing both sides of the face\",\n    \"effect\": \"smooth, fine, slightly wispy synthetic-dyed texture with soft cool highlights and a few naturally separated strands\"\n  },\n  \"body\": {\n    \"frame\": \"slim upper-body portrait, with the shoulders and torso filling the lower frame\",\n    \"waist\": \"not visible\",\n    \"chest\": \"mostly covered by layered black clothing\",\n    \"legs\": \"not visible\",\n    \"skin\": {\n      \"visible_areas\": [\n        \"face\",\n        \"neck\",\n        \"shoulders\",\n        \"upper chest around the neckline\",\n        \"hands and fingers\"\n      ],\n      \"tone\": \"very fair neutral-cool complexion\",\n      \"texture\": \"soft youthful skin with subtle natural pores, faint tonal variation, and realistic facial texture\",\n      \"lighting_effect\": \"soft diffuse indoor light creates gentle highlights on the forehead, nose, cheeks, and fingers without strong directional shadows\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"pose\": {\n    \"position\": \"upper body close to the camera\",\n    \"base\": \"one hand is raised toward the lower face, with the fingers positioned near the lips in a playful gesture\",\n    \"overall\": \"close, slightly hunched selfie posture with the head tilted subtly toward the camera and shoulders relaxed\"\n  },\n  \"clothing\": {\n    \"top\": {\n      \"type\": \"black gothic-inspired layered blouse or dress\",\n      \"color\": \"deep matte black\",\n      \"details\": \"ruffled shoulders, gathered fabric, lace panels, layered neckline, loose sleeves, subtle straps and textured black-on-black detailing\",\n      \"effect\": \"soft matte fabric with deep folds and rich shadow separation between the lace and outer layers\"\n    },\n    \"bottom\": {\n      \"type\": \"not visible\",\n      \"color\": \"not visible\",\n      \"details\": \"not applicable\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"accessories\": {\n    \"headwear\": \"none clearly visible\",\n    \"jewelry\": \"minimal dark necklace or thin accessory partially visible near the neckline\",\n    \"device\": \"front-facing smartphone camera, device outside the visible frame\",\n    \"prop\": \"none\"\n  },\n  \"photography\": {\n    \"camera_style\": \"casual front-camera smartphone selfie with an early social-media / Japanese alternative-fashion photo aesthetic\",\n    \"angle\": \"slightly high angle, very close to the face\",\n    \"shot_type\": \"extreme close-up portrait / tight upper-body selfie\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"approximately 4:5 vertical\",\n    \"texture\": \"slightly soft digital image, mild compression, subtle sensor noise, gentle highlight bloom, natural smartphone processing\",\n    \"lighting\": \"soft overhead indoor ambient light with weak frontal fill, relatively flat illumination and gentle shadows under the chin and clothing folds\",\n    \"depth_of_field\": \"moderate depth of field; face and foreground remain sharp while the room behind her is somewhat softer\"\n  },\n  \"background\": {\n    \"setting\": \"casual indoor dressing room, bedroom, backstage room, or alternative-fashion studio\",\n    \"wall_color\": \"off-white and pale gray\",\n    \"elements\": [\n      \"large mirror\",\n      \"blurred person reflected in the mirror\",\n      \"dark clothing\",\n      \"black boots\",\n      \"guitar or musical equipment\",\n      \"casual room objects\"\n    ],\n    \"atmosphere\": \"unpolished, intimate, candid, slightly underground alternative-fashion atmosphere\",\n    \"lighting\": \"ordinary cool-neutral indoor lighting without dramatic studio illumination\"\n  },\n  \"the_vibe\": {\n    \"energy\": \"playful, mischievous, intimate\",\n    \"mood\": \"quietly rebellious and cute with a slightly strange internet-selfie quality\",\n    \"aesthetic\": \"Japanese alternative fashion, gothic lolita-adjacent styling, silver-lavender hair, black lace, nostalgic social-media selfie\",\n    \"authenticity\": \"retain imperfect framing, ordinary indoor lighting, mild compression, slight softness, visible background clutter, and natural hair irregularities\",\n    \"intimacy\": \"very close camera distance makes the portrait feel personal and spontaneous\",\n    \"story\": \"A quick selfie taken indoors before or after an alternative-fashion event, with the subject deliberately making a playful expression for the camera.\",\n    \"caption_energy\": \"just being a little strange today\"\n  },\n  \"constraints\": {\n    \"must_keep\": [\n      \"very pale silver-lavender bob\",\n      \"heavy straight bangs\",\n      \"large dark eyes\",\n      \"very close selfie composition\",\n      \"black gothic-inspired clothing\",\n      \"ruffled and lace textures\",\n      \"fair cool-toned skin\",\n      \"direct eye contact\",\n      \"playful hand-near-mouth gesture\",\n      \"ordinary indoor background\",\n      \"large mirror\",\n      \"casual smartphone image quality\",\n      \"slightly imperfect framing\",\n      \"soft diffuse lighting\",\n      \"alternative Japanese fashion atmosphere\"\n    ],\n    \"avoid\": [\n      \"commercial studio portrait\",\n      \"glamour photography\",\n      \"perfect beauty retouching\",\n      \"plastic skin\",\n      \"CG hair\",\n      \"excessive makeup\",\n      \"overly sexualized styling\",\n      \"dramatic cinematic lighting\",\n      \"clean empty background\",\n      \"perfect symmetry\",\n      \"extra fingers\",\n      \"deformed hands\",\n      \"extra arms\",\n      \"incorrect hair color\",\n      \"bright colorful clothing\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"negative_prompt\": [\n    \"studio portrait\",\n    \"glamour shoot\",\n    \"plastic skin\",\n    \"CG hair\",\n    \"heavy makeup\",\n    \"oversexualized\",\n    \"dramatic lighting\",\n    \"clean background\",\n    \"perfect symmetry\",\n    \"extra fingers\",\n    \"deformed hands\",\n    \"extra arms\",\n    \"wrong hair color\",\n    \"bright clothing\",\n    \"excessive retouching\"\n  ]\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2-t-8boAAtN_z.jpg"]},{"i":19135,"text":"照这 5 点写：\n① 第一句定调：什么风景 + 什么时间的光\n② 写清主角在哪：略偏左、画面中下\n③ 主角要小，环境要大，越渺小越有感觉\n④ 光只打在主角上，周围压暗\n⑤ 结尾列\"不要\"：no people, no text…\n\n这张图的提示词👇\n\nA photorealistic vertical 9:16 coastal landscape photograph viewed from an elevated seaside residence during the final moments of golden hour, looking outward across a calm deep-blue sea toward a solitary volcanic island in the distance.\n\nDesign the composition around a strong sense of quiet scale and spaciousness. A large area of open sea and sky should dominate the vertical frame, while only a few carefully placed elements create the visual structure.\n\nAlong the far left edge of the frame, part of a simple Mediterranean coastal house enters vertically as a natural foreground frame. Only a narrow section of the warm cream-colored stucco wall, a dark recessed window, a small terracotta roof edge and several subtle architectural details should be visible. The building must remain secondary and partially cropped by the frame, suggesting that the photograph is being taken from a hillside residence overlooking the sea.\n\nDark Mediterranean pine branches and dense coastal vegetation occupy the lower-left foreground, while a mature pine tree rises along the lower-right and right edge of the frame. These foreground elements should remain relatively dark, forming a soft natural frame around the brighter open water in the center rather than competing for attention.\n\nThe middle of the image opens onto a broad expanse of calm dark blue Mediterranean water with very fine realistic ripples and restrained reflections. A single small white sailing yacht rests or moves very slowly across the sea slightly below the center of the vertical frame. Its mast rises clearly against the darker water, while the low warm evening sunlight strikes the white hull directly, creating a small but powerful golden highlight. The yacht should remain tiny relative to the surrounding sea, emphasizing distance, solitude and scale.\n\nFar beyond the sailboat, a single large rugged volcanic island rises from the horizon slightly right of center. The island has a low asymmetric mountain profile, steep rocky slopes and naturally eroded ridges, with most of its surface falling into muted brown, olive and blue-gray evening shadow. One side may retain a faint trace of warm grazing sunlight, but the island should remain mostly subdued and darker than the sky.\n\nAbove the island, a small isolated cloud catches the final sunset light and glows softly in muted salmon-pink and warm peach tones. Keep the rest of the sky extremely simple and spacious: clear deep blue toward the upper portion of the frame, gradually becoming softer and slightly warmer near the horizon. Do not add dramatic cloud formations.\n\nUse an elevated hillside viewpoint with a natural eye-level-to-slightly-downward perspective and subtle telephoto compression. The foreground house and trees should frame the scene while the sailboat and island remain visually aligned through the open center of the composition. Preserve clear spatial separation between foreground vegetation, middle-distance yacht, distant island and sky.\n\nLow-angle sunset light enters from the left side of the scene. It softly warms the left building facade, selected edges of the right-side pine tree, a few grasses near the bottom of the frame, and most importantly the white yacht hull. The surrounding sea remains cool dark blue, creating a strong but physically believable warm-versus-cool contrast. Shadows should stay deep and natural rather than artificially lifted.\n\nThe overall mood is quiet, secluded and contemplative, like a real photograph taken from a Mediterranean island home during the last few minutes before sunset. Maintain realistic materials, restrained color, natural atmospheric distance and authentic photographic exposure.\n\nNo people, no additional boats, no coastal city, no dense buildings on the island, no dramatic sunset sun disk, no oversized clouds, no artificial HDR, no excessive orange-and-teal grading, no neon colors, no fantasy landscape, no distorted architecture, no obvious AI artifacts, no text, logos or watermarks.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3AeeoaEAAvfhn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3AhKqb0AAcnvY.jpg"]},{"i":19136,"text":"和参考图，\n图1：GPT-image\n图2：Grok\n图3：Gemini\n图4：Muse\n除了GPT，其它几张都抽了2次卡。最可惜的还是Gemini，掉队不是一星半点。提示词👇\n\n用上传的参考图中人物面部形象结合下面提示词生成一张新的图片：Extreme close-up macro portrait of a beautiful young woman's(Match only the facial features of the reference model with very high identity accuracy. Preserve the exact eye shape and spacing, nose structure and proportions, lip shape, chin shape, jawline definition, cheekbone structure, forehead proportions, facial symmetry, skin tone, and overall facial geometry. Keep the face instantly recognizable while allowing changes to hairstyle, expression, clothing, pose, camera angle, lighting, and background as specified in the prompt. Do not alter the core facial anatomy or identity) face in profile, cinematic dramatic lighting, highly detailed.  Outfit: Bare neck and collarbone visible, shoulders off-camera suggesting an elegant, minimal, or absent top to keep all visual focus strictly on the facial features and lighting.  Pose: Head tilted back, chin raised prominently, neck extended. Lips are relaxed, plump, and slightly parted. Eyes are open, looking upward and slightly forward. The angle is a tight profile/three-quarter profile emphasizing the jawline, lips, nose, and cheekbone curvature.  Scene & Background: Dark, moody studio setting. The background is a solid, seamless gradient of deep, dark navy blue merging into pitch black. Zero background distractions, purely atmospheric.  Color & Temperature: High-contrast, dual-tone neon gel lighting.  Warm tone: A sharp, intense neon red spotlight grazes the face from above/front, striking the bridge of the nose, the tip of the upper lip, the prominent curve of the chin, and casting a sliver of light on the forehead and the iris.  Cool tone: A deep, rich cyan/blue ambient fill light bathes the jawline, neck, lower cheek, and the underside of the nose. The interplay creates intense shadows and striking color saturation.  Technical Specifications: Photorealistic, 8k resolution, masterpiece, RAW photo, ultra-high definition. Extreme attention to microscopic details: visible skin pores, fine peach fuzz illuminated by the rim light, glossy wet texture on the lips, individual sharp eyelashes, and delicate stray strands of hair falling across the cheek and neck. Volumetric lighting, highly detailed specular highlights on the skin and lips.  Composition: Extreme macro close-up. The frame cuts off the back of the head, the top of the hair, and just below the neck. The face fills the entire canvas, utilizing the negative space on the left side to balance the glowing profile.  Camera Details: Shot on medium format camera, 100mm macro lens, f/2.8 aperture for a slightly shallow depth of field that keeps the eye, nose, and lips in razor-sharp focus while allowing the neck and far edge of the face to fall off softly. ISO 100, 1/125s shutter speed.  Aspect Ratio: --ar 9:16(Vertical orientation)  Negative Prompt: ugly, plastic skin, smooth skin, airbrushed, cartoon, illustration, low resolution, poorly drawn, out of focus, deformed, text, watermark, bad anatomy, overexposed, flat lighting, natural daylight, bright background, standard lighting, asymmetrical facial features, crossed eyes.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3Z8zNakAAjBeb.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3Z-7gaQAATIrs.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3aBkma4AAeqj0.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3aFJPaoAAnRyk.jpg"]},{"i":19137,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n摄影风格：日间清亮高光CCD生活照风\n写真方向：都市文艺时尚生活照\n场景方向：现代户外杂志书报亭 / 白色展示架 / 彩色杂志封面 / 浅灰街道 / 极简商业街\n服装方向：柠檬橙色修身方领短袖短上衣 + 奶油白低腰A字超短裙\n气质标签：明亮、文艺、俏皮、自然、时尚\n五官方向：明媚清秀初恋脸\n身形方向：轻盈纤细\n线条强调：中偏强\n镜头方向：半身到大腿\n姿态动作：一只手拿一本薄杂志，另一只手轻靠展示架，刚从杂志抬眼看向镜头\n光线氛围：晴天高亮自然光 + 白色展示架与浅色街道提供柔和反射补光\n滤镜效果：高亮清晰橙白CCD色彩 + 白皙肤色 + 鲜明中间调 + 轻颗粒\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：杂志封面只负责丰富背景色彩，不能抢人物；柠檬橙高明度、略高饱和但不偏黄；画面轻松、有城市周末感","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT7yDHuaYAAHrtv.jpg"]},{"i":19138,"text":"Create an exceptionally beautiful, highly detailed cinematic interior artwork titled “If [COUNTRY] Had a Bedroom.”\n\nImagine that the entire personality, culture, architecture, landscapes, colors, traditions, and atmosphere of [COUNTRY] have been transformed into one dreamlike bedroom.\n\nThe bedroom should feel luxurious yet authentic, not like a generic themed room. Every object should subtly tell the story of the country.\n\nInclude culturally recognizable details through elegant interior design: traditional materials, local patterns, iconic objects, regional flowers, books, artwork, architecture-inspired furniture, textiles, lighting, food or drink details, and a large window revealing a breathtaking view inspired by [COUNTRY].\n\nThe bed should be the visual centerpiece — beautifully styled with layered fabrics, textured cushions, and subtle patterns inspired by the country's heritage.\n\nAdd small unexpected details that reward viewers for zooming in.\n\nThe room should feel lived-in, peaceful, aspirational and cinematic, rather than like a museum or tourist attraction.\n\nUse natural golden-hour light entering through the window, realistic shadows, soft atmospheric depth, sophisticated interior photography, rich textures, subtle imperfections, ultra-realistic materials, editorial luxury travel magazine aesthetic.\n\nNo people. No excessive flags. No obvious stereotypical decorations. Keep the design sophisticated and believable.\n\nA small elegant handwritten inscription somewhere in the room:\n“If [COUNTRY] had a bedroom…”\n\nVertical 4:5 composition, photorealistic, highly detailed, visually addictive, Pinterest-worthy, premium aesthetic.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3eeQbaYAAmEGL.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3efQAasAEXVaU.jpg"]},{"i":19139,"text":"适合封面、社媒图文和系列插画。这组配图就用了它的社论涂鸦风格与社媒卡排版思路，AI 辅助生成。\n\n③ LiveCanvas｜把变化过程展示出来\n从核实内容、设计分镜，到用 Remotion 编排动画，交付封面、MP4，以及支持环境下的 Apple Live Photo 资源。适合时间线、数据变化和过程演示。\n\n我的选法：\n讲透一个观点 → 小黑配图\n找到合适画风 → handraw-style\n展示一段变化 → LiveCanvas\n\n也可以组合起来：先提炼观点，再统一视觉，最后按需加动画。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3mMlWbwAEoEIS.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3mMlKacAEJFCO.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3mMk3bIAArMaF.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT3mMlOaEAE0V0W.jpg"]},{"i":19140,"text":"Create a premium professional character reference sheet using the uploaded REFERENCE IMAGE as the ONLY identity reference for the MAIN SUBJECT.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nThe final image MUST contain EXACTLY 10 frames/panels.\nDo NOT add extra frames.\nDo NOT remove any frames.\nDo NOT change the panel arrangement.\n\nUse the following EXACT 2-ROW, 10-FRAME layout:\n\nTOP ROW = 5 FACE / HEAD-AND-SHOULERS VIEWS\nBOTTOM ROW = 5 FULL-BODY VIEWS\n\nThe composition, number of frames, pose sequence, and camera angles must remain exactly as specified below.\n\n==================================================\nREFERENCE & IDENTITY LOCK\n==================================================\n\nUse the uploaded reference image as the single source of truth for the MAIN SUBJECT'S identity.\n\nPreserve the person's exact:\n- Facial identity\n- Facial structure\n- Skin tone\n- Eye shape and natural eye color\n- Eyebrows\n- Nose\n- Lips\n- Jawline\n- Cheek structure\n- Hairstyle\n- Hairline\n- Hair color\n- Hair texture\n- Hair length\n- Age appearance\n- Natural facial features\n- Body proportions\n- Physique\n- Overall recognizable appearance\n\nThe reference may be MALE or FEMALE.\n\nIf the reference is male, keep the subject male.\nIf the reference is female, keep the subject female.\n\nDo NOT change the person's identity.\nDo NOT create a different-looking version of the person.\nDo NOT beautify or modify facial structure.\n\n==================================================\nEXACT FINAL LAYOUT — 10 FRAMES\n==================================================\n\nROW 1 — FACE REFERENCE\nExactly 5 frames:\n\nFRAME 1:\nFRONT VIEW\n- Straight-on face\n- Head facing directly toward camera\n- Neutral expression\n- Head and shoulders visible\n\nFRAME 2:\n3/4 LEFT VIEW\n- Head turned approximately 45 degrees to the subject's LEFT\n- Face clearly visible\n- Head and shoulders visible\n\nFRAME 3:\nLEFT PROFILE\n- Exact left-side profile\n- Approximately 90-degree rotation\n- Nose, lips, chin, jawline and hair silhouette clearly visible\n\nFRAME 4:\n3/4 RIGHT VIEW\n- Head turned approximately 45 degrees to the subject's RIGHT\n- Face clearly visible\n- Head and shoulders visible\n\nFRAME 5:\nRIGHT PROFILE\n- Exact right-side profile\n- Approximately 90-degree rotation\n- Complete facial silhouette clearly visible\n\nTOP ROW ORDER MUST BE:\n\nFRONT | 3/4 LEFT | LEFT PROFILE | 3/4 RIGHT | RIGHT PROFILE\n\n==================================================\nROW 2 — FULL BODY REFERENCE\n==================================================\n\nExactly 5 frames:\n\nFRAME 6:\nFRONT FULL-BODY VIEW\n- Subject standing naturally\n- Facing directly toward camera\n- Entire body visible from head to feet\n- Arms naturally relaxed beside the body\n- Feet visible\n\nFRAME 7:\n3/4 LEFT FULL-BODY VIEW\n- Body rotated approximately 45 degrees to the subject's LEFT\n- Entire body visible\n- Natural standing posture\n- Feet visible\n\nFRAME 8:\nLEFT PROFILE FULL-BODY VIEW\n- Exact left-side profile\n- Body rotated approximately 90 degrees\n- Entire body visible from head to feet\n\nFRAME 9:\n3/4 RIGHT FULL-BODY VIEW\n- Body rotated approximately 45 degrees to the subject's RIGHT\n- Entire body visible\n- Natural standing posture\n- Feet visible\n\nFRAME 10:\nBACK FULL-BODY VIEW\n- Subject facing completely away from camera\n- Full back visible\n- Entire body visible from head to feet\n- Hair visible from the back\n- Natural standing posture\n\nBOTTOM ROW ORDER MUST BE:\n\nFRONT | 3/4 LEFT | LEFT PROFILE | 3/4 RIGHT | BACK\n\n==================================================\nCRITICAL CONSISTENCY\n==================================================\n\nALL 10 FRAMES MUST SHOW EXACTLY THE SAME PERSON.\n\nMaintain identical:\n- Face\n- Hair\n- Hairline\n- Hair color\n- Facial proportions\n- Body proportions\n- Height\n- Physique\n- Skin tone\n- Age appearance\n- Clothing\n- Accessories\n\nThe person must not look like 10 different generations.\n\nThe facial identity must remain consistent between every frame.\n\nThe body proportions must remain consistent between every full-body frame.\n\n==================================================\nCLOTHING\n==================================================\n\nUse one simple, clean, fitted outfit suitable for a professional character/model reference sheet.\n\nThe EXACT SAME outfit must appear in all 10 frames.\n\nDo not change clothing between panels.\n\nDo not change hairstyle between panels.\n\nDo not change accessories between panels.\n\nIf the uploaded reference has an important recognizable hairstyle or appearance, preserve it.\n\n==================================================\nBACKGROUND & PRESENTATION\n==================================================\n\nClean professional light-gray/white studio background.\n\nMinimal environment.\n\nNo scenery.\n\nNo props.\n\nNo dramatic background.\n\nNo unnecessary objects.\n\nAll 10 frames should appear as one professionally photographed character reference sheet.\n\nUse consistent studio lighting across every frame.\n\nSoft, neutral, evenly distributed lighting.\n\nMinimal shadows.\n\n==================================================\nCAMERA CONSISTENCY\n==================================================\n\nUse consistent professional studio photography.\n\nFACE FRAMES:\nHead-and-shoulders framing.\n\nFULL-BODY FRAMES:\nHead-to-feet framing with the entire body completely visible.\n\nMaintain consistent camera height, focal length, lighting, and distance.\n\nAvoid wide-angle distortion.\n\nKeep facial proportions natural and accurate.\n\n==================================================\nPANEL DESIGN\n==================================================\n\nCreate a clean rectangular 2-row grid.\n\nExactly 5 equal-width panels on the TOP ROW.\n\nExactly 5 equal-width panels on the BOTTOM ROW.\n\nAll panels should have matching dimensions.\n\nClean spacing between panels.\n\nProfessional production-model-sheet appearance.\n\nAdd small, clean labels beneath or within each panel:\n\nTOP:\nFRONT\n3/4 LEFT\nLEFT PROFILE\n3/4 RIGHT\nRIGHT PROFILE\n\nBOTTOM:\nFRONT\n3/4 LEFT\nLEFT PROFILE\n3/4 RIGHT\nBACK\n\nLabels must be small, clean, professional, and unobtrusive.\n\n==================================================\nPOSE LOCK\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT invent additional poses.\n\nUse ONLY these specified views and poses.\n\nTOP ROW:\n1. Front\n2. 3/4 Left\n3. Left Profile\n4. 3/4 Right\n5. Right Profile\n\nBOTTOM ROW:\n6. Front\n7. 3/4 Left\n8. Left Profile\n9. 3/4 Right\n10. Back\n\nThe pose sequence must remain exactly the same.\n\n==================================================\nPROFESSIONAL USE\n==================================================\n\nThe resulting sheet should function as a professional character-consistency reference for:\n\nAI image generation\nAI video generation\nAnimation\nFilm production\nStoryboarding\nCharacter design\nFashion visualization\n3D character development\n\nEvery angle should clearly communicate the same person's identity and physical appearance.\n\n==================================================\nNEGATIVE CONSTRAINTS\n==================================================\n\nEXACTLY 10 FRAMES ONLY.\n\nNo 8 frames.\nNo 9 frames.\nNo 11 frames.\nNo extra portraits.\nNo extra poses.\nNo additional panels.\n\nNo identity change.\nNo different person.\nNo face variation.\nNo face blending.\nNo gender change.\nNo age change.\nNo hairstyle change.\nNo hair color change.\nNo body-shape change.\nNo inconsistent clothing.\nNo inconsistent proportions.\nNo duplicated panels.\nNo missing panels.\nNo distorted profile.\nNo distorted hands.\nNo extra fingers.\nNo extra limbs.\nNo cropped feet in full-body frames.\nNo cropped head in face frames.\nNo extreme camera distortion.\nNo cartoon style.\nNo CGI appearance.\nNo plastic skin.\nNo text except the specified small view labels.\nNo watermark.\nNo logo.\n\nFINAL OUTPUT:\nA single clean professional 2-row × 5-column character reference sheet containing EXACTLY 10 consistent views of the same person.\n\nRESOLUTION LOCK:\nGenerate the final image in 16K resolution — 15360 × 8640 pixels (≈132.7 million pixels), landscape 16:9 composition.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2IZybbgAAg0qD.jpg"]},{"i":19141,"text":"生成图片：一位年轻成年女性站在夏日开阔绿色草地中央，黑色自然垂落长发被微风轻轻带起，辣妹造型，手腕佩戴银色手表，冷白纤细肤色，瘦长脸型，脸颊利落，狐系眼睛直视镜头，肩颈修长，身形纤细。她以正面半身构图呈现，身体微微侧转，姿态松弛又有酷感。远处可见木质栅栏和停放车辆，晴朗阳光在草地上投下清晰影子。写实清新摄影，明亮夏日色调，古早DV录像质感，轻微过曝，柔焦微糊，低饱和胶片颗粒，自然逆光与高光。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT4QRQfacAI-N45.jpg"]},{"i":19142,"text":"Create a 30-second one-take ultra-realistic UGC video filmed on an Apple iPhone front camera. A woman in a beige sweater slices a highly realistic cake shaped like a cute cat in a bright modern kitchen, while the real fluffy cat sits in the background. Natural smartphone exposure, slight handheld movement, realistic depth of field, casual everyday UGC feel. No image reference, no text, subtitles, logos, or watermark.\n\n[0–6s]\nStatic medium shot. The woman casually slices the realistic cat-shaped cake on a wooden counter. The real fluffy cat sits in the background, watching the cake curiously.\n\n[6–12s]\nAs the knife cuts into the cake, the cat suddenly jumps onto its hind legs, opens its mouth wide, and reacts as if screaming in exaggerated horror. Its facial expressions and movements become comically dramatic while keeping the cat photorealistic.\n\n[12–18s]\nThe woman immediately stops cutting, looks at the cat, and bursts out laughing. The cat continues its ridiculous reaction, waving its paws and staring at the cake as if desperately trying to stop her.\n\n[18–24s]\nShe looks between the cake and the cat, laughing harder. The cat keeps dramatically “screaming” and bouncing on its hind legs, creating an absurdly funny reaction.\n\n[24–30s]\nThe cat drops back onto all fours and stares suspiciously at the cake. The woman laughs toward the phone camera. Just before the video ends, the cat gives one final exaggerated scream and she completely loses it laughing.\n\nSTYLE: photorealistic fluffy cat and cake, realistic fur and anatomy, exaggerated but believable CGI facial expressions, natural human performance, Apple iPhone front-camera quality, casual daily UGC aesthetic, natural kitchen lighting, subtle handheld movement, realistic depth of field, spontaneous comedy, 4K.\n\nAUDIO: realistic kitchen ambience, knife cutting through cake, dramatic exaggerated cat screaming, natural woman laughter, subtle room tone. No dialogue, no text, no subtitles, no logos, no watermark.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107145348271783936/img/kONY__S5HnKYf4qO.jpg"]},{"i":19143,"text":"It's an interesting style and works well for thought provoking visuals.\n\nPrompt: \n2x2 grid, 16:9, AI picks philosophical debates or our time: INPUT ::= [ARGUMENT_OR_THESIS]\n\nSTEP_1 :: infer the argument\n- state the thesis in one sentence\n- who benefits, and who pays\n- the tension: two forces that cannot both win\n\nSTEP_2 :: infer the substitution\n- take a familiar scene and replace exactly one element with a wrong one\n- swap scale, material, or function — one of the three, never all\n- describable in one sentence, unforgettable in one glance\n\nSTEP_3 :: infer the restraint\n- one metaphor only; a second destroys both\n- forbidden: text, arrows, labels, symbols printed on foreheads\n- ambiguity is permitted, confusion is not\n\nSTEP_4 :: infer the treatment\n- three or four flat colours plus a single texture\n- shape-first — everything must read as silhouette\n- faces generic or absent so the idea stays universal\n- print character: risograph, screenprint, gouache, litho crayon\n\nSTEP_5 :: render spec\n- square or portrait, generous negative space\n- flat lighting, no rendering performed for its own sake\n- vector-clean edges carrying hand-made grain\n- the concept must survive being printed four centimetres wide","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT1Ca0KWgAANbMf.jpg"]},{"i":19144,"text":"生成一张3:4竖版艺术海报，完整单张。用少量宽厚的丙烯颜料笔触，在空间中组成【主体】。\n每一笔直接承担轮廓、体积和动作，大色块概括形体。\n配色：【配色】。能近看见刷毛平行沟槽、起笔蓄料、厚薄起伏和相互叠压；收笔处逐渐变薄、自然分叉，局部有干刷毛边。主体前后结构清楚，侧光照出颜料厚度、遮挡关系和柔和投影，细节真实而不油腻。\n文字只有大字“【题字】”及小字“笔触成体”“AI绘画每日一词”，使用精心设计的【中文现代黑体】，字号反差强烈。\n构图与文字位置：【构图】。纯色干净背景，大块安静空间，少而有力的视觉元素，出版级艺术指导。不要光滑塑料彩带、纸条、金属、玻璃、毛线，不要真实物体外面涂颜料，不要平面油画，不要装饰边框、图标、无关英文或其他文字。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n1、花\n【主体】一朵有五片宽阔花瓣的抽象花，花心与花瓣由独立但叠压连接的厚颜料扫刷组成，没有花盆\n【配色】花瓣珊瑚红和朱红，花心一小笔明黄，茎叶深墨绿，暖象牙白背景，文字深炭黑\n【题字】花\n【构图】一朵花从画面右下方向左上开放，占画面宽度约三分之二；巨大的‘花’字在左上角，与右下方花朵形成对角平衡；右上方和左下方保留空白，小字沿左下角基线排列\n2、翼\n【主体】一只侧身向左上方振翅的抽象飞鸟，翅膀由三笔宽厚扫刷构成，身体是一笔短厚颜料，尾部两笔收尖，鸟的姿态一眼可辨\n【配色】鸟由钴蓝、深靛蓝和少量冰蓝组成，浅冷灰背景，文字钴蓝\n【题字】翼\n【构图】飞鸟占据画面上半部，张开的翅膀形成斜向上的动势；巨大的‘翼’字坐落左下区域，小字紧邻底部，画面中部与右下方留下宽阔空白，主体与字不接触\n3、游\n【主体】一尾侧身向下游动的抽象金鱼，躯干是一笔饱满短刷痕，展开的尾鳍由三笔有间隙的宽厚扫刷构成，尾鳍和身体前后叠接，剪影清楚\n【配色】鱼身杏橙、赭红与奶油白，深藏蓝纯色背景，文字奶油白\n【题字】游\n【构图】游鱼从左上向右下弯出一个弧形，主体在左侧中下方；巨大的‘游’字位于右上，右下保留成片深蓝空白，小字放在右下方，疏密与明暗反差鲜明\n\n📌 一句话总结\n笔触既是材料，也是结构：用几笔大形体，把厚度、方向和动作交代清楚。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT6XZFTasAA_m-_.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT6XZFRbsAAZhYZ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT6XZFRa4AA8HjV.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT6XZFfa4AAihkO.jpg"]},{"i":19145,"text":"Create a cinematic close-up portrait of a stylish young woman standing beside a large glass window, quietly looking toward her reflection. She is dressed in a black turtleneck layered beneath a tailored dark blazer, giving her a sophisticated, timeless appearance.\n\nGentle daylight enters through the window, softly lighting one side of her face while leaving the other in a subtle natural shadow. This creates depth, mood, and an introspective feeling.\n\nKeep the background softly out of focus so the woman remains the main visual focus. Her reflection appears naturally across the glass, adding a beautiful sense of duality and quiet self-reflection.\n\nThe overall visual style should feel moody, elegant, cinematic, and sophisticated, with muted neutral colors, soft daylight, realistic skin texture, shallow depth of field, and a refined editorial photography aesthetic.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT6vpg-bIAAadRx.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT6vp-7aUAEEi5H.jpg"]},{"i":19146,"text":"A striking top-down art photograph of a famous packaged food/snack from [COUNTRY], placed on a clean white sheet of paper. At the very top of the paper, write “[COUNTRY NAME]” in large, bold, beautiful typography. Directly underneath, place a realistic, colorful packet of “[FAMOUS FOOD/SNACK]” from that country. The packet is creatively split/opened down the center, and the inside artwork transforms into a vibrant miniature illustration of the country — featuring its most iconic landmark, architecture, landscape, cultural elements and recognizable local details. Keep the original food packet highly realistic with authentic-looking folds, crinkles, printed graphics and vivid colors, while the emerging country illustration uses expressive colored-pencil and wax-crayon strokes. White paper background, overhead composition, playful handmade imperfections, rich saturated colors, premium editorial art photography, extremely detailed, visually satisfying, viral social-media aesthetic.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT7BQTIbcAA7KQi.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT7BQTJasAAU2Fq.jpg"]},{"i":19147,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n主题方向：东方禅意极简封面海报\n风格分支：女性审美高传播型\n主体内容：一位古风女子站在一扇巨大高门前，回头轻看镜头方向\n情绪母题：进入、期待、轻故事感\n场景与意象：巨大靛蓝色门体、奶白墙面、女子、浅色地面、少量光影\n构图与空间：9:16竖版构图，高门位于中上部形成主视觉，人物位于下方偏中，门体上方和一侧留出大面积标题区\n色彩控制：奶白作为背景和地面基底，靛蓝用于高门主体，浅金或暖光只用于门边少量高光，人物服装用浅白或浅蓝白；避免全图发蓝\n光线与质感：明亮午后日光，门体投下清晰但简洁的阴影，平面插画海报感\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：门必须大而简洁，透视感明确，画面干净高颜值，适合封面首图，画面留白处配上合适的文字","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUApCV6agAAmpVM.jpg"]},{"i":19148,"text":";\nCreate a highly realistic autumn countryside photograph featuring the girl from the attached reference image. Preserve her identity exactly, including her facial structure, distinctive features, natural proportions, hairstyle, and overall appearance.\n\nShe is standing beside a weathered wooden fence in an open rural pasture, casually resting one hand on the fence while keeping one leg slightly bent in a relaxed pose. In her other hand, she carries a small black leather handbag.\n\nHer outfit consists of a warm brown jacket layered over a black knitted sweater and a visible white shirt underneath, paired with a short plaid skirt, clean white socks, and tall black leather boots. Keep the clothing realistic with natural folds, stitching, material texture, and subtle signs of everyday wear.\n\nBehind her is a wide autumn meadow with several black cows grazing naturally in the distance. Surround the pasture with a mixture of evergreen conifers and deciduous trees covered in rich yellow, amber, and muted orange foliage. An overcast sky provides soft, diffused daylight across the entire scene.\n\nAim for the look of an authentic professional outdoor photograph rather than an AI-generated image. Show realistic skin pores, fine facial details, individual strands of hair, natural imperfections, detailed fabric fibers, aged wood grain, grass texture, and believable environmental details. Use physically accurate lighting, shadows, reflections, perspective, and depth of field with natural optical characteristics.\n\nMuted seasonal colors, subtle contrast, realistic exposure, authentic photographic depth, and a slightly editorial countryside aesthetic. Absolutely no artificial skin smoothing, waxy or plastic appearance, excessive sharpening, CGI look, 3D rendering, painterly effects, or blurry/mushy details.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT7vG08aoAAUv-a.jpg"]},{"i":19149,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n摄影风格：日间清亮高光CCD生活照风\n写真方向：都市滨水时尚生活写真\n场景方向：现代城市白色斜拉步行桥 / 白色钢索 / 浅灰桥面 / 蓝绿色河面 / 远处城市楼群\n服装方向：覆盆子紫红色修身U领吊带短上衣 + 冷白色低腰修身超短裙\n气质标签：明艳、清爽、时尚、松弛、有女人味\n五官方向：精致明媚自然脸\n身形方向：轻盈纤细\n线条强调：强\n镜头方向：大腿及上半身\n姿态动作：沿桥面慢走，走过镜头后轻微回身，一只手轻扶白色钢索，回头自然微笑\n光线氛围：晴天高亮自然光 + 白色桥体与水面共同形成清亮反射补光\n滤镜效果：高亮清晰紫红白CCD色彩 + 白净肤色 + 鲜明中间调 + 稳定黑位 + 轻颗粒\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：覆盆子紫红显色鲜明但不要玫红荧光感；水面负责增加清透度，白色钢索形成强构图线；上衣自然表现肩颈、锁骨和胸线","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUBCndcboAAqY-L.jpg"]},{"i":19150,"text":"Type\": \"image_generation_prompt\",\n  \"title\": \"Red in Focus — Urban Editorial Portrait (Female)\",\n  \"style\": \"urban editorial, analog aesthetic, cinematic, high-fashion\",\n  \"concept\": {\n    \"description\": \"An editorial portrait captured from above with a bold analog aesthetic and urban atmosphere. The female model stands on a vibrant red background, projecting confidence, style, and strong visual presence.\",\n    \"mood\": \"confident, warm, cinematic\",\n    \"color_palette\": [\"red\", \"black\", \"gold\", \"white\"]\n  },\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"gender\": \"female\",\n    \"identity_preservation\": {\n      \"use_reference_image\": true,\n      \"alter_face\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"Maintain the woman’s facial features and physical appearance exactly as in the reference image.\"\n    },\n    \"pose\": {\n      \"name\": \"Red Adjustment\",\n      \"posture\": \"standing with body slightly leaning forward\",\n      \"hand_action\": \"one hand adjusting rectangular sunglasses\",\n      \"expression\": \"firm, confident, commanding presence\"\n    },\n    \"appearance\": {\n      \"hair\": {\n        \"length\": \"short\",\n        \"texture\": \"curly\"\n      },\n      \"makeup\": {\n        \"style\": \"clean, editorial, subtle emphasis on eyes and skin\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"wardrobe\": {\n    \"blazer\": \"black leather blazer with a tailored cut\",\n    \"top\": \"plain black T-shirt\",\n    \"pants\": \"dark slim-cut trousers\",\n    \"shoes\": \"red and white sneakers\",\n    \"hat\": \"black cap with the word \\\"PromptStack\\\" in a stylized font\",\n    \"sunglasses\": \"black rectangular sunglasses\"\n  },\n  \"accessories\": {\n    \"necklaces\": \"layered gold chains\",\n    \"rings\": \"metallic rings\"\n  },\n  \"environment\": {\n    \"background\": {\n      \"color\": \"solid vibrant red\",\n      \"style\": \"minimalist, graphic, high-impact\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"lighting\": {\n    \"type\": \"soft and even lighting\",\n    \"shadows\": \"no harsh shadows\",\n    \"effect\": \"reinforces warm, cinematic mood\"\n  },\n  \"camera\": {\n    \"camera_model\": \"Canon EOS R5\",\n    \"lens\": \"35mm f/1.4\",\n    \"aperture\": \"f/2.0\",\n    \"iso\": 200,\n    \"shutter_speed\": \"1/250s\",\n    \"angle\": \"high angle, directly above the subject\",\n    \"framing\": \"vertical 4:5, focused on face and upper body\",\n    \"resolution\": \"Ultra-HD 8K\"\n  },\n  \"visual_effects\": {\n    \"film_grain\": \"realistic 35mm film grain\",\n    \"vignette\": \"subtle vignette around edges\",\n    \"texture_focus\": [\n      \"skin\",\n      \"leather blazer\",\n      \"accessories\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"quality\": {\n    \"realism\": \"ultra-realistic\",\n    \"detail_level\": \"editorial-grade detail with analog texture\"\n  },\n  \"output_goal\": \"Create a bold, ultra-realistic urban fashion editorial portrait of a woman with a strong red visual identity, analog film texture, and confident cinematic presence.\"\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT72PRqb0AAzVpP.jpg"]},{"i":19151,"text":"使用 3 个面板在摄影棚背景前，创建这个人的真实角色表：全身正面视图无头部，全身背面视图头部可见，面部特写镜头\n2、动作迁移：选官方走秀模板，用 Genjutsu 把模特步套到大叔身上 \n直接让codex去Higgsfield官网推荐该人物合适的视频，或者你自己给视频给codex，然后后续根据这个视频把上面的人物进行替换即可\n3、氛围拉满：让codex去找合适的背景音乐节奏，齐活！\n\n🎁 官方现在有 3 天 MCP 试用 + 100 积分，你在codex进行插件安装及登录的时候，就会提醒你有3天的试用（需绑卡，注意试用期之前需要进行取消，避免到期之后进行续费）： \n#Codex #Higgsfield #AI视频 #AIAnimation","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT75fI3akAEd7--.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT75dFga8AEzj4r.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107395989032353792/img/_YaJTKxHo0JyLcZE.jpg"]},{"i":19152,"text":"中文的文字清晰度和错字问题大幅改善！\n\n中文字体设计和排版的美学也非常好，主要是没有 GPT 那种破碎感，画面干净！\n\n它比 GPT 的主要优势在于可以生成 4K 图片，感觉一下又有用了呀！\n\n当然，价格还是挺贵的。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT9kW-CbIAALhow.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT9lOJhasAAekOr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT9lm1tboAArkcj.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT9l8DBbwAAXh27.jpg"]},{"i":19153,"text":"share:\nAn eccentric Mad Hatter seated at one end of an impossibly long table suspended high above a vast mist-filled canyon, elaborate emerald top hat decorated with crooked brass pins and colorful feathers, wild auburn hair, extravagant purple and black coat, hundreds of empty mismatched chairs stretching into the distance, cups and saucers hovering several inches above the tabletop while streams of tea curve upward against gravity, tablecloth rippling despite perfectly still air, Hatter calmly stirring one cup while staring directly toward the viewer, dramatic sunrise breaking through heavy clouds, surreal but photorealistic, rich saturated colors, extraordinary depth, intricate textures, cinematic HD --ar 9:16 --v 8.2 --hd","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT-v2EvW8AAbY4v.jpg"]},{"i":19154,"text":"s 👇🧵\n\nTest 1: 8 objects, exact counts, exact positions, a clock showing 10:42.\n\nreview: 1 of the 4 got everything right. \nThe misses were an \n8th paperclip, \n7 pencils instead of 5, \na die showing 5 instead of 3, \nand 2 clocks with the hour and minute hands swapped. The handwritten word was spelled right in all 4\n\nPrompt\n\nModel: Nano Banana 2.1 on Higgsfield | 1:1 | 2K | thinking: high\n\n{\n  \"shot\": \"top-down flat lay, 90-degree overhead, photorealistic, sharp focus edge to edge\",\n  \"surface\": \"weathered oak table\",\n  \"lighting\": \"soft north-facing window light from the top edge of frame\",\n  \"objects\": [\n    \"exactly 3 red apples in the top-left corner\",\n    \"exactly 7 silver paperclips in a straight horizontal line along the bottom edge\",\n    \"a round analogue wall clock in the centre with hands clearly showing 10:42\",\n    \"one blue ceramic mug, handle pointing right, in the top-right corner\",\n    \"exactly 5 yellow pencils fanned out to the left of the clock\",\n    \"a single green leaf resting on top of the mug rim\",\n    \"2 white dice showing a 6 and a 3, bottom-right corner\",\n    \"an open notebook on the right of the clock with the handwritten word 'ADHERENCE'\"\n  ],\n  \"rules\": [\"every count is exact\", \"every position is exact\", \"no other objects, no people, no hands, no extra fruit\"]\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT91-puWEAAgS-3.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT91-piXUAAnKQY.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT91-pjXQAA2DTv.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT91-psXEAA9zb9.jpg"]},{"i":19155,"text":"adherence on complex, multi-layer instructions\n• Sharper, cleaner text rendering\n• Multi-image fusion with up to 14 reference images\n• 1K, 2K and 4K output at Flash-level speed and cost\n\nText in AI images keeps getting less garbled.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT-G83sXAAAmPna.jpg"]},{"i":19156,"text":"生成一张3:4竖版艺术海报，以【标本】为唯一主视觉，呈现蓝晒接触印相的数字艺术效果。画面正对纸面，无透视倾斜。\n主体按【构图】排列，占画面约三分之二，保留完整、容易辨认的外形和自然间隙。主体是留在纸上的平面浅色印痕，色调从暖白过渡到淡蓝；内部透光层次依据所填标本的实际结构形成，细处清晰，少量边缘柔化。\n背景为浓郁普鲁士蓝的棉纸，细微纸纤维、刷涂边缘和局部浓淡变化都克制，至少四分之一画面保持安静的单一色域。均匀柔光，不表现实物投影。\n全图唯一可见文字必须逐字准确写为“【题字】”，禁止自行改标题、另起标题或添加诗句。\n仅使用这段中文题字，使用清晰醒目的【现代宋体】，以疏密和字号对比形成设计感，安排在主体旁的完整色域内，文字不压住主体。蓝、淡蓝、暖白三色统一。\n不要立体浮雕、发光描边、真实物体摆拍、装饰边框、额外物件、英文、商标或水印。\n输出一张完整海报，不做拼贴。\n\n🔁延伸玩法\n1、林间拾光\n标本：一枝舒展的蕨叶\n构图：从右下向左上斜伸，左下安排题字\n题字：林间拾光\n2、风的形状\n标本：两枚轻盈的羽毛\n构图：一长一短交错但不重叠，主体偏左，右上安排题字\n题字：风的形状\n3、旧日花窗\n标本：一片圆形镂空蕾丝\n构图：完整圆形偏右下，左上安排题字\n题字：旧日花窗\n这套模板适合轮廓清楚、有细密结构或镂空的薄片状对象。三组示例均用同一段提示词替换参数生成，呈现的是数字蓝晒视觉效果。\n\n📌一句话总结\n把颜色收进一片深蓝，让日常物件的轮廓和透光纹理成为主角。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT_Y62JbAAAHMjr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT_Y62GagAAMcon.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT_Y9IZaIAAAG47.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT_Y9IabIAADBFt.jpg"]},{"i":19157,"text":"A medium shot cinematic portrait of a woman looking over her shoulder, inspired by the provided reference photo. She features the same facial structure, striking light eyes, and long, dark, slightly wavy hair flowing down her back. She is wearing an elaborate, textured crimson or deep red gown with a low back, covered in an intricate overlay of delicate, frosty white branching or silver root-like structures that wrap around her shoulders and dress. She stands in a mystical, dark gothic forest at night, next to ancient, overgrown stone arch ruins. In the background, a glowing full moon shines through mist, casting a cool blue light with small, floating magical glowing particles or fireflies. Dark fantasy aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting, ultra-detailed textures, and ethereal realism.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUCsav9WsAAWViL.jpg"]},{"i":19158,"text":"里的元素遮挡与版面排布。官方放出的 Infographic 评测基准里，准确率从前代的 0.179 涨到了 0.521，海报文字和图表结构的崩坏率降得很明显\n\n另一个实用改动是一致性支持。单次 Prompt 最多可以传 14 张参考图，在多轮对话连续修改里能同时锁定 4 个独立角色和 10 个关键物体，不用再为换个背景重抽卡\n\n不过开了 high thinking 之后，端到端生成的耗时会翻倍。跑无文字的普通质感图没必要开思考档，只有带排版、带多角色交互的图才值得把这部分等待","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT_uhDNaMAEXTny.jpg"]},{"i":19159,"text":"Use the reference image as the exact identity reference. Preserve the subject’s facial identity, facial proportions, hairstyle, body proportions and natural appearance. Create a photorealistic high-fashion street-style photograph in London. The subject is standing outside a classic British townhouse with a muted blue-gray paneled door and black wrought-iron railings. She wears a fitted black ribbed turtleneck, oversized dark brown vintage leather jacket with a soft shearling collar, brown mini skirt, and carries a structured dark brown leather handbag with gold hardware. Oversized dark sunglasses, minimal makeup, effortless model-off-duty expression. Overcast natural daylight, muted neutral color palette, realistic shadows, authentic leather texture, subtle film grain, editorial fashion photography, candid street photography, 50mm lens, shallow depth of field, extremely photorealistic, no text, no watermark.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT_77TfbgAEUH-F.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT_77TgaIAETUgr.jpg"]}];